# Commands run by the launchd job com.annibale.demo (see com.annibale.demo.plist).
# The home screen in edit mode (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.jiggle, gpu=1): a long press on an empty place makes
# the icons jiggle and puts the translucent minus on each of them. Then SpringBoard writes down the
# layers it has on the screen (com.annibale.layers, see inject_sb.c), which names the badge's views.
/annibale/bin/sound_test springboard
/annibale/bin/anntouch wait 25 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 8
/annibale/bin/anntouch hold 0.5 0.62 2000
/annibale/bin/anntouch wait 6 notify com.annibale.layers wait 10
